# GamingAlliance content repo (Ripseync/Gamon).
#
# These files are distributed to players byte-for-byte and their SHA1 is
# recorded in manifest.json. Git MUST NOT rewrite line endings, or the served
# bytes (LF) would no longer match the manifest hash (computed from the source
# CRLF copies) and the launcher would re-download every text file on every
# launch. `-text` disables all EOL conversion so every file is stored verbatim.
* -text
